# Elrokian Hunter's Proof (Q111), second part: a level 75 character on cond 4 with 49 journal
# fragments and nine claws, bones and skins kills a velociraptor for the last fragment, takes the
# expedition letter from Marquez to Kirikashin, learns the song, makes Asamah's trap from an
# ornithomimus claw, a pachycephalosaurus skin and a deinonychus bone (every roll pinned to
# succeed), and Kirikashin gives the Elrokian trap, its stones and adena; then relog. Expectations replay the reference trace of this scenario.
